		<category><![CDATA[Trouble]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.savagechickens.com/?p=33561</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Wishing Karina a very happy birthday, a little early this year because Karina&#8217;s birthday is on Sunday. Hope you have a wonderful day, Karina!!! 🙂 Today&#8217;s comic is the 22nd birthday comic I&#8217;ve drawn for Karina&#8217;s birthday! Here are all of Karina&#8217;s comics: Happy Birthday &#8211; Birthday &#8211; Birthday Party &#8211; Party Pooper &#8211; Birthday [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://www.savagechickens.com/wp-content/uploads/chickensurrounded-1.jpg" alt="Surrounded" width="400" height="767" /></p>
<p>Wishing <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/tag/karinas-birthday">Karina a very happy birthday</a>, a little early this year because Karina&#8217;s birthday is on Sunday. Hope you have a wonderful day, Karina!!! <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/72x72/1f642.png" alt="🙂" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></p>
<p>Today&#8217;s comic is the 22nd birthday comic I&#8217;ve drawn for <a href="https://www.dougsavage.com/celebrating-karinas-birthday/">Karina&#8217;s birthday</a>! Here are all of <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/tag/karinas-birthday">Karina&#8217;s comics</a>: <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2005/08/happy-birthday.html">Happy Birthday</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2006/08/birthday.html">Birthday</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2007/08/birthday-party.html">Birthday Party</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2008/08/party-pooper.html">Party Pooper</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2009/08/birthday-essentials.html">Birthday Essentials</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2010/08/getting-wiser.html">Getting Wiser</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2011/08/king-kong.html">King Kong</a> – <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2012/08/dog-days.html">Dog Days</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2013/08/looking-great.html">Looking Great</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2014/08/finally.html">Finally</a> – <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2015/08/best-cake-ever.html">Best Cake Ever</a> – <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2016/08/the-perfect-gift.html">The Perfect Gift</a> &#8211; <a href="http://www.savagechickens.com/2017/08/truly.html">Truly</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2018/08/cause-for-celebration-2.html">Cause for Celebration</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2019/08/better-with-age.html">Better With Age</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2020/08/virtual-birthday-greetings.html">Virtual Birthday Greetings</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2021/08/the-dorito-promise.html">The Dorito Promise</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2022/08/adulting.html">Adulting</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2023/08/old-enough.html">Old Enough</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2024/08/older-wiser-and-more.html">Older, Wiser, and More!</a> &#8211; <a href="https://www.savagechickens.com/2025/08/clownfish.html">Clownfish</a> &#8211; Surrounded</p>
